"仅提供只读查看。F1/G4 使用各自地址表；标记“通用”的寄存器名称相近，但仍应以当前型号参考手册或 SVD 为准。" = "Read-only inspection. F1/G4 use separate address tables. Generic entries have similar names; verify addresses against the device reference manual or SVD.";
"从任意有效地址读取。常见区域：SRAM 0x20000000，Flash 0x08000000；外设地址请以当前芯片参考手册或 SVD 为准。" = "Read any valid address. Common regions: SRAM 0x20000000, Flash 0x08000000. Verify peripheral addresses against the device reference manual or SVD.";
"添加后会在每次暂停、单步或点击“刷新状态”时重新读取。可监视全局变量、结构体成员、数组元素和地址表达式。" = "Watches refresh on pause, step, or Refresh State. Inspect globals, structure members, array elements, and address expressions.";
"将用当前 ELF 改写 Flash。请确认固件与 %@ 匹配。" = "This writes the current ELF to Flash. Confirm the firmware matches %@.";

